{"code":"G3","wikidata":"Q104212244","wikipedia":{"en":"Khlong San station","th":"สถานีคลองสาน"},"summary":{"en":"Khlong San station is a Gold Line station, located in Khlong San District, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is on Somdet Chao Phraya Road, in front of Taksin Hospital. It opened on 16 December 2020.","th":"สถานีคลองสาน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าแบบยกระดับ ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้าสายสีทอง โดยสถานีจะยกระดับเหนือถนนสมเด็จเจ้าพระยา เขตคลองสาน กรุงเทพมหานคร สถานีดังกล่าวเป็นสถานีสุดท้ายในโครงการรถไฟฟ้าสายสีทอง ช่วงที่ 1 ระยะแรก"},"opened":"2020-12-16","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Gold_line_G3_station.jpg/960px-Gold_line_G3_station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gold_line_G3_station.jpg","author":"Oum13928","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/%28THA-Bangkok%29_Gold_Line_APM01_%40_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_%281%29.jpg/960px-%28THA-Bangkok%29_Gold_Line_APM01_%40_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:(THA-Bangkok)_Gold_Line_APM01_@_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_(1).jpg","author":"S5A-0043","license":"Attribution"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/%28THA-Bangkok%29_Gold_Line_APM01_%40_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_%282%29.jpg/960px-%28THA-Bangkok%29_Gold_Line_APM01_%40_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:(THA-Bangkok)_Gold_Line_APM01_@_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_(2).jpg","author":"S5A-0043","license":"Attribution"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/%28THA-Bangkok%29_Gold_Line_APM01_%40_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_%283%29.jpg/960px-%28THA-Bangkok%29_Gold_Line_APM01_%40_Khlong_San_2024-02-12_%283%29.jpg?ut